{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 60-90 minute <strong><i>proof of concept</i></strong> for One-Thousand Cuts, <strong>plenty of exploration</strong> (over a dozen hidden cats to pet, an optional boss, bonus lore drops, three alternative video modes), <strong>unlockable upgrades,</strong> a <strong>three-phase final boss</strong>, and <strong>multiple endings</strong> based on which moral route you choose. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037690/extras/70035defeaff434288b14703941b5261.poster.avif?t=1746036272\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037690/extras/70035defeaff434288b14703941b5261.webm?t=1746036272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine <strong>instant-death combat</strong> with <strong>unique special abilities</strong> and environmental hazards to devastate your enemies, or die trying. Strategize efficient solutions or overwhelm with brute force as your slice your way through the <strong>Army of One-Thousand</strong>, one cut at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037690/extras/e045947849b32f68f9f54a025e95ea07.poster.avif?t=1746036272\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037690/extras/e045947849b32f68f9f54a025e95ea07.webm?t=1746036272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover and fight </strong>a deadly collection of challenging bosses on your journey. Master each of their martial art styles to unleash powerful <strong>combat techniques</strong> on your enemies. <strong>If</strong> you can defeat them, that is. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037690/extras/b376f8e6be32dd586ee6fcc3802438eb.poster.avif?t=1746036272\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037690/extras/b376f8e6be32dd586ee6fcc3802438eb.webm?t=1746036272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hidden lore throughout a rich, low-fantasy Edo Japan. connect the shattered pieces of this expansive world, inspired by real Japanese history and folklore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037690/extras/f493151f5bc400b21faeb84356b504ee.poster.avif?t=1746036272\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037690/extras/f493151f5bc400b21faeb84356b504ee.webm?t=1746036272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The time of the samurai is coming to an uncertain end. Exiled as a child by his father, young <strong>Hiroyuki</strong> grew up at his <strong>Uncle Jiro's </strong> secluded dojo, hoping one day to prove himself worthy enough to return home. Now caught at the center of a hostile takeover within his clan, Hiro is torn between <strong>loyalty</strong>  and <strong>honor</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037690/extras/2b55e7a3d12b5223ebc43ca9344514c8.poster.avif?t=1746036272\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037690/extras/2b55e7a3d12b5223ebc43ca9344514c8.webm?t=1746036272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Honor:</strong> Armed with the Dragon\u2019s Fang\u2013a legendary sword\u2013side with his father to kill Uncle Jiro and regain his honor in the eyes of the clan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loyalty:</strong> Armed with a bokken\u2013a wooden training sword\u2013side with Uncle Jiro to face down the fearsome army under his father's control. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It only takes one cut to kill, but what is one man against the Army of One-Thousand?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prologue Contents</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 60-90 minutes of content (skill-level dependent) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Over a dozen hidden cats to discover and pet </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Nearly 100 NPCs with unique names and backstories </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Two moral routes with their own endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- An optional two-phase miniboss</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unlockable upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Three-phase final boss</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Full (skippable) tutorial</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Three alternate video modes, including Kurosawa Mode (black and white film), Vintage CRT screen, and [REDACTED]</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3037690?t=1746036272","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037690/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746036272","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037690/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746036272","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037690/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746036272","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"If you choose the Honorable path, expect a nonstop phantasmagoria of fantasy violence, gore, and high-pressure arterial blood spray piping hot from the classic chanbara films that inspired it. Brief and infrequent references to tobacco and alcohol consumption. "},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>\u26e9\ufe0f WISHLIST AND FOLLOW THE FULL GAME \u26e9\ufe0f</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 60-90 minute <strong><i>proof of concept</i></strong> for One-Thousand Cuts, <strong>plenty of exploration</strong> (over a dozen hidden cats to pet, an optional boss, bonus lore drops, three alternative video modes), <strong>unlockable upgrades,</strong> a <strong>three-phase final boss</strong>, and <strong>multiple endings</strong> based on which moral route you choose. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037690/extras/70035defeaff434288b14703941b5261.poster.avif?t=1746036272\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037690/extras/70035defeaff434288b14703941b5261.webm?t=1746036272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine <strong>instant-death combat</strong> with <strong>unique special abilities</strong> and environmental hazards to devastate your enemies, or die trying. Strategize efficient solutions or overwhelm with brute force as your slice your way through the <strong>Army of One-Thousand</strong>, one cut at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037690/extras/e045947849b32f68f9f54a025e95ea07.poster.avif?t=1746036272\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037690/extras/e045947849b32f68f9f54a025e95ea07.webm?t=1746036272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover and fight </strong>a deadly collection of challenging bosses on your journey. Master each of their martial art styles to unleash powerful <strong>combat techniques</strong> on your enemies. <strong>If</strong> you can defeat them, that is. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037690/extras/b376f8e6be32dd586ee6fcc3802438eb.poster.avif?t=1746036272\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037690/extras/b376f8e6be32dd586ee6fcc3802438eb.webm?t=1746036272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hidden lore throughout a rich, low-fantasy Edo Japan. connect the shattered pieces of this expansive world, inspired by real Japanese history and folklore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037690/extras/f493151f5bc400b21faeb84356b504ee.poster.avif?t=1746036272\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037690/extras/f493151f5bc400b21faeb84356b504ee.webm?t=1746036272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The time of the samurai is coming to an uncertain end. Exiled as a child by his father, young <strong>Hiroyuki</strong> grew up at his <strong>Uncle Jiro's </strong> secluded dojo, hoping one day to prove himself worthy enough to return home. Now caught at the center of a hostile takeover within his clan, Hiro is torn between <strong>loyalty</strong>  and <strong>honor</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037690/extras/2b55e7a3d12b5223ebc43ca9344514c8.poster.avif?t=1746036272\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037690/extras/2b55e7a3d12b5223ebc43ca9344514c8.webm?t=1746036272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Honor:</strong> Armed with the Dragon\u2019s Fang\u2013a legendary sword\u2013side with his father to kill Uncle Jiro and regain his honor in the eyes of the clan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loyalty:</strong> Armed with a bokken\u2013a wooden training sword\u2013side with Uncle Jiro to face down the fearsome army under his father's control. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It only takes one cut to kill, but what is one man against the Army of One-Thousand?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prologue Contents</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 60-90 minutes of content (skill-level dependent) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Over a dozen hidden cats to discover and pet </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Nearly 100 NPCs with unique names and backstories </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Two moral routes with their own endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- An optional two-phase miniboss</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unlockable upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Three-phase final boss</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Full (skippable) tutorial</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Three alternate video modes, including Kurosawa Mode (black and white film), Vintage CRT screen, and [REDACTED]</p>","developers":["Banjo Toad Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037690/header.jpg?t=1746036272","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a9BanjoToadStudioLLC 2024","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3037690/709301/933bc2b367339cded3db740d0b8ceb3e7201425f/1750959992/dash_av1.mpd?t=1718873722","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3037690/709301/933bc2b367339cded3db740d0b8ceb3e7201425f/1750959992/dash_h264.mpd?t=1718873722","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3037690/709301/933bc2b367339cded3db740d0b8ceb3e7201425f/1750959992/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1718873722","id":257028311,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257028311/movie480.mp4?t=1718873722","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257028311/movie_max.mp4?t=1718873722"},"name":"NarrativeTrailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257028311/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1718873722","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257028311/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1718873722","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257028311/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1718873722"}}],"name":"One-Thousand Cuts: 